{"headword":"חָשַׁךְ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. be, grow dark (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲשַׁךְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܫܶܟ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَسِكَ</span> <em>bear rancour</em>, v. Lag<sup>BN 30</sup><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.30\">Is 5:30</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָֽשְׁכָה</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:6\" href=\"/Micah.3.6\">Mi 3:6</a> (but v. infr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽשְׁכוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.17\">La 5:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָֽשְׁכוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.3\">Ec 12:3</a>; Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּחְשַׁךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.2\">Ec 12:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֶּחְשַׁךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:15\" href=\"/Exodus.10.15\">Ex 10:15</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחְשְׁכוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:9\" href=\"/Job.3.9\">Jb 3:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 3:3\" href=\"/Job.3.3\">3</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּחְשַׁכְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:24\" href=\"/Psalms.69.24\">ψ 69:24</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be, grow dark</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.30\">Is 5:30</a>, cf. (fig.) <a data-ref=\"Job 18:6\" href=\"/Job.18.6\">Jb 18:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.16\">Is 13:16</a> (fig.); <span dir=\"rtl\">היום</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.18\">Ez 30:18</a> (where read <span dir=\"rtl\">חשׁך</span>, for MT Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">חשׂך</span>); <a data-ref=\"Job 3:9\" href=\"/Job.3.9\">Jb 3:9</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">כוכבים</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.2\">Ec 12:2</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">השׁמשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">האור</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הירח</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הכוכבים</span>); impers. <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:6\" href=\"/Micah.3.6\">Mi 3:6</a> (si vera l.; but read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַחֲשֵׁכָה</span>, corresponding with <span dir=\"rtl\">לַיְלָה</span> preceding)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>have a dark colour:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מִשְּׁחוֹר תָּֽאֳרָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.8\">La 4:8</a> <em>darker than blackness is their visage;</em> of the earth <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:15\" href=\"/Exodus.10.15\">Ex 10:15</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>grow dim</em> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.17\">La 5:17</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">עינינו</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:24\" href=\"/Psalms.69.24\">ψ 69:24</a> (fig.), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.3\">Ec 12:3</a> subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֹאוֹת</span> i.e. the eyes"}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחְשִׁיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:8\" href=\"/Amos.5.8\">Am 5:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהַחֲשַׁכְתִּ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:9\" href=\"/Amos.8.9\">Am 8:9</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲשִׁיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:12\" href=\"/Psalms.139.12\">ψ 139:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְשִׁךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.16\">Je 13:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְשִׁךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:28\" href=\"/Psalms.105.28\">ψ 105:28</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְשִׁיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:2\" href=\"/Job.38.2\">Jb 38:2</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>make dark</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יום לילה הח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:8\" href=\"/Amos.5.8\">Am 5:8</a>; abs. <em>cause darkness</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.16\">Je 13:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:28\" href=\"/Psalms.105.28\">ψ 105:28</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:9\" href=\"/Amos.8.9\">Am 8:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לארץ)</span>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>hide, conceal</em>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמֶּךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:12\" href=\"/Psalms.139.12\">ψ 139:12</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. <em>obscure, confuse</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:2\" href=\"/Job.38.2\">Jb 38:2</a> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵצָה</span>)."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB03567","strong_numbers":["2821"],"next_hw":"חֹ֫שֶׁךְ","prev_hw":"חֻשִׁים²","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["3124"],"TWOT":["769"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}